{"kind":"article","metadata":{"role":"article","title":"エンドポイントの定義","roleHeading":"Article","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"modules":[{"name":"APIContract"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"このガイドでは、APIContractの各マクロの詳細な使い方と、様々なパターンのエンドポイント定義を説明します。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Endpoint%E3%83%9E%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"@Endpointマクロ"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Endpoint"},{"text":"マクロは、構造体をAPIエンドポイントに変換します。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A7%8B%E6%96%87","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"基本構文"},{"code":["@Endpoint(.httpMethod, path: \"optional\/sub\/path\")","struct EndpointName {","    \/\/ パラメータ定義","    typealias Output = ResponseType","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"HTTP%E3%83%A1%E3%82%BD%E3%83%83%E3%83%89","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"HTTPメソッド"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"サポートされるHTTPメソッド："}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"メソッド"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"用途"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".get"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"リソースの取得"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".post","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"リソースの作成"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".put","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"リソースの完全更新","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".patch","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"リソースの部分更新"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".delete"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"リソースの削除","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".head"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ヘッダーのみ取得"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".options"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"許可メソッドの確認","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"anchor":"%E3%83%91%E3%82%B9%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"パス指定"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"パスは省略可能です。省略した場合、グループのベースパスが使用されます。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ パスなし → グループのベースパスのみ","@Endpoint(.get)","struct List { ... }","","\/\/ パスあり → グループのベースパス + サブパス","@Endpoint(.get, path: \":id\")","struct Get { ... }","","\/\/ 複雑なパス","@Endpoint(.get, path: \":userId\/posts\/:postId\/comments\")","struct GetComments { ... }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"%E3%83%91%E3%83%A9%E3%83%A1%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BF%E3%83%9E%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"パラメータマクロ"},{"anchor":"PathParam","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"@PathParam"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URLパス内のプレースホルダーに対応するパラメータを定義します。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Endpoint(.get, path: \":userId\/posts\/:postId\")","struct GetPost {","    @PathParam var userId: String","    @PathParam var postId: String","","    typealias Output = Post","}","","\/\/ 生成されるパス: \/users\/123\/posts\/456","let endpoint = GetPost(userId: \"123\", postId: \"456\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"QueryParam","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"@QueryParam"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URLクエリパラメータを定義します。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Endpoint(.get)","struct SearchUsers {","    @QueryParam var query: String          \/\/ 必須","    @QueryParam var limit: Int?            \/\/ オプション","    @QueryParam(\"page_size\") var pageSize: Int?  \/\/ カスタム名","","    typealias Output = [User]","}","","\/\/ 生成されるURL: \/users?query=john&limit=10&page_size=20","let endpoint = SearchUsers(query: \"john\", limit: 10, pageSize: 20)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Body","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"@Body"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"リクエストボディを定義します。"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"type":"text","text":"に準拠した型を使用します。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct CreateUserRequest: Codable {","    let name: String","    let email: String","}","","@Endpoint(.post)","struct CreateUser {","    @Body var body: CreateUserRequest","","    typealias Output = User","}","","\/\/ リクエストボディがJSON形式でエンコードされる","let endpoint = CreateUser(body: CreateUserRequest(name: \"John\", email: \"john@example.com\"))"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"%E5%9E%8B%E3%82%B5%E3%83%9D%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"型サポート"},{"anchor":"%E3%83%91%E3%83%A9%E3%83%A1%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BF%E3%81%A7%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E3%81%AA%E5%9E%8B","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"パラメータで使用可能な型"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"以下の型がパスパラメータとクエリパラメータで使用できます："}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"文字列"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"整数"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int8"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int16"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int32"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int64"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt8"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt16"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt32"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt64"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"浮動小数点","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Float"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"真偽値"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"日付"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"Date","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"（ISO8601形式で自動変換）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enum"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RawRepresentable"},{"type":"text","text":"な型"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["enum Status: String {","    case active, inactive","}","","@Endpoint(.get)","struct FilterUsers {","    @QueryParam var status: Status","    @QueryParam var createdAfter: Date?","","    typealias Output = [User]","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E3%81%AA%E5%9E%8B","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"特殊な型"},{"anchor":"EmptyInput","type":"heading","level":4,"text":"EmptyInput"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"パラメータなしのエンドポイントに使用します。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Endpoint(.get)","struct GetServerStatus {","    typealias Output = ServerStatus","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"EmptyOutput","type":"heading","level":4,"text":"EmptyOutput"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"レスポンスボディがないエンドポイント（DELETEなど）に使用します。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Endpoint(.delete, path: \":id\")","struct DeleteUser {","    @PathParam var id: String","    typealias Output = EmptyOutput","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"APIGroup%E3%83%9E%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"@APIGroupマクロ"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"関連するエンドポイントをグループ化し、共通のベースパスと認証設定を定義します。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A7%8B%E6%96%87","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"基本構文"},{"code":["@APIGroup(path: \"\/v1\/resource\", auth: .required)","enum ResourceAPI {","    \/\/ エンドポイント定義","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"%E8%AA%8D%E8%A8%BC%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%B6","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"認証要件"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"値"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"説明","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".none","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"認証不要"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".required","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"認証必要","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"anchor":"%E3%82%B0%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%97%E5%8C%96%E3%81%AE%E4%BE%8B","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"グループ化の例"},{"code":["\/\/ ユーザーAPI","@APIGroup(path: \"\/v1\/users\", auth: .required)","enum UsersAPI {","    @Endpoint(.get) struct List { ... }","    @Endpoint(.get, path: \":id\") struct Get { ... }","    @Endpoint(.post) struct Create { ... }","    @Endpoint(.put, path: \":id\") struct Update { ... }","    @Endpoint(.delete, path: \":id\") struct Delete { ... }","}","","\/\/ 認証API（認証不要）","@APIGroup(path: \"\/v1\/auth\", auth: .none)","enum AuthAPI {","    @Endpoint(.post, path: \"login\") struct Login { ... }","    @Endpoint(.post, path: \"register\") struct Register { ... }","    @Endpoint(.post, path: \"refresh\") struct Refresh { ... }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E3%81%AA%E4%BE%8B","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"完全な例"},{"code":["import APIContract","","\/\/ モデル定義","struct User: Codable {","    let id: String","    let name: String","    let email: String","}","","struct CreateUserRequest: Codable {","    let name: String","    let email: String","}","","struct UpdateUserRequest: Codable {","    let name: String?","    let email: String?","}","","\/\/ API定義","@APIGroup(path: \"\/v1\/users\", auth: .required)","enum UsersAPI {","    @Endpoint(.get)","    struct List {","        @QueryParam var limit: Int?","        @QueryParam var offset: Int?","        @QueryParam var status: String?","","        typealias Output = [User]","    }","","    @Endpoint(.get, path: \":userId\")","    struct Get {","        @PathParam var userId: String","","        typealias Output = User","    }","","    @Endpoint(.post)","    struct Create {","        @Body var body: CreateUserRequest","","        typealias Output = User","    }","","    @Endpoint(.patch, path: \":userId\")","    struct Update {","        @PathParam var userId: String","        @Body var body: UpdateUserRequest","","        typealias Output = User","    }","","    @Endpoint(.delete, path: \":userId\")","    struct Delete {","        @PathParam var userId: String","","        typealias Output = EmptyOutput","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"APIContractでエンドポイントを定義する詳細なガイド。","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/apicontract\/definingendpoints"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/APIContract\/documentation\/APIContract"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/APIContract\/documentation\/APIContract\/DefiningEndpoints","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"はじめに","identifiers":["doc:\/\/APIContract\/documentation\/APIContract\/GettingStarted"],"anchor":"はじめに","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://APIContract/documentation/APIContract":{"url":"\/documentation\/apicontract","identifier":"doc:\/\/APIContract\/documentation\/APIContract","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"APIContract","abstract":[{"text":"Swiftマクロを活用した型安全なAPIコントラクト定義ライブラリ。","type":"text"}]},"doc://APIContract/documentation/APIContract/GettingStarted":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/APIContract\/documentation\/APIContract\/GettingStarted","title":"はじめに","url":"\/documentation\/apicontract\/gettingstarted","abstract":[{"text":"APIContractを使用してAPIエンドポイントを定義する方法を学びます。","type":"text"}],"role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article"}}}